  "description": "Lightweight .NET class for reading and writing fixed-width data files. Includes basic reader and writer class, and also generic classes that automatically map class properties to fixed-width fields. Includes many options to control the library's behavior. Now targets either .NET 5.0 or .NET Standard 2.0, and supports nullable reference types.",
